{"embedding_dim": 512, "data": [{"__id__": "chunk-072bd8c7b2afb32dd32c9fff15fb14ee", "__created_at__": 1778125769, "content": "[Memory]\nuid: ce395\ntype: fact\ntopic: boundary_condition_employee_skill_tags\nimportance: 0.7\nttl_days: 30\ntimestamp: 1778125769\n\ncontent:\n员工技能标签为空时，系统会默认低优先级，可能导致新人排班过少。\n\n[Memory]\nuid: b6993\ntype: constraint\ntopic: new_store_exclusion\nimportance: 0.5\nttl_days: 30\ntimestamp: 1778125769\n\ncontent:\n新增门店先不进来，避免这轮验证被样本变化干扰。\n\n[Memory]\nuid: 9eb6d\ntype: preference\ntopic: product_documentation_emphasis\nimportance: 1.0\nttl_days: 180\ntimestamp: 1778125769\n\ncontent:\n产品文案需要强调系统是建议工具，不会替代门店经理最终决策，这一点对一线接受度很关键。\n\n[Memory]\nuid: ab7a4\ntype: goal\ntopic: project_discussion_plan\nimportance: 0.5\nttl_days: 14\ntimestamp: 1778125769\n\ncontent:\n如果两周后指标稳定，我们再讨论全量；如果解释面板仍然不够清楚，就先把项目目标从全量上线改成区域试点。\n\n[Memory]\nuid: 09360\ntype: task\ntopic: polaris_explanation_panel_structure\nimportance: 0.5\nttl_days: 30\ntimestamp: 1778125769\n\ncontent:\nPolaris 的解释面板我想拆成三层：先给门店经理看结论，再展示触发的关键约束，最后保留详细日志给审计使用。\n\n[Memory]\nuid: 15862\ntype: task\ntopic: schedule_result_table_updates\nimportance: 0.5\nttl_days: 30\ntimestamp: 1778125769\n\ncontent:\n排班结果表需要加上 rule_version、model_version 和 manual_override_reason 三个字段。", "full_doc_id": "doc-072bd8c7b2afb32dd32c9fff15fb14ee", "file_path": "unknown_source", "vector": ""}, {"__id__": "chunk-89ad3c256cf0ee0c90812d66e68cec8a", "__created_at__": 1778125799, "content": "[Memory]\nuid: dd6d1\ntype: fact\ntopic: polaris_weekly_report\nimportance: 0.5\nttl_days: 30\ntimestamp: 1778125799\n\ncontent:\nPolaris智能排班 的周报已更新，绿色项已完成，黄色项需协作，红色项与节假日客流波动有关。\n\n[Memory]\nuid: 2c798\ntype: fact\ntopic: orion_weekly_report\nimportance: 0.5\nttl_days: 30\ntimestamp: 1778125799\n\ncontent:\nOrion海外支付网关 的周报已更新，绿色项已完成，黄色项需协作，红色项与不同地区合规要求差异大有关。\n\n[Memory]\nuid: c2a3f\ntype: task\ntopic: falcon_tracking\nimportance: 0.5\nttl_days: 30\ntimestamp: 1778125799\n\ncontent:\nFalcon风控中台 的埋点漏了一段，需前端补充从配置页返回列表页的路径。\n\n[Memory]\nuid: 14cdb\ntype: fact\ntopic: orion_risks\nimportance: 0.5\nttl_days: 30\ntimestamp: 1778125799\n\ncontent:\nOrion海外支付网关 本周风险没有新增，但有两个旧风险未关闭：第三方沙箱返回码不稳定，接口回滚方案未演练。\n\n[Memory]\nuid: 08af4\ntype: task\ntopic: xingqiao_acceptance_criteria\nimportance: 0.5\nttl_days: 30\ntimestamp: 1778125799\n\ncontent:\n星桥CRM 目前最缺的是一致的验收口径，需先补齐口径表。\n\n[Memory]\nuid: 7e5a6\ntype: fact\ntopic: polaris_audit_log\nimportance: 0.5\nttl_days: 180\ntimestamp: 1778125799\n\ncontent:\nPolaris 的审计日志字段已入库，法务可按门店、日期和规则版本过滤抽查。\n\n[Memory]\nuid: 99a3f\ntype: task\ntopic: bluewhale_alerts\nimportance: 0.5\nttl_days: 30\ntimestamp: 1778125799\n\ncontent:\n蓝鲸报表 昨晚的告警因批处理延迟触发阈值，需改清楚告警描述以避免误判。\n\n[Memory]\nuid: 4f64c\ntype: task\ntopic: xingqiao_export_query\nimportance: 0.5\nttl_days: 30\ntimestamp: 1778125799\n\ncontent:\n星桥CRM 客户询问下个版本是否支持导出，需按“规划中但未承诺日期”回复。\n\n[Memory]\nuid: fb16a\ntype: fact\ntopic: polaris_decision_change\nimportance: 0.5\nttl_days: 180\ntimestamp: 1778125799\n\ncontent:\nPolaris 的决策变更已同步给管理层，后续不再引用旧的5月底全量计划。\n\n[Memory]\nuid: 8de26\ntype: fact\ntopic: falcon_weekly_report\nimportance: 0.5\nttl_days: 30\ntimestamp: 1778125799\n\ncontent:\nFalcon风控中台 的周报已更新，绿色项已完成，黄色项需协作，红色项与策略回放数据量太大有关。\n\n[Memory]\nuid: b7247\ntype: fact\ntopic: xingqiao_weekly_report\nimportance: 0.5\nttl_days: 30\ntimestamp: 1778125799\n\ncontent:\n星桥CRM 的周报已更新，绿色项已完成，黄色项需协作，红色项与历史客户数据字段不一致有关。\n\n[Memory]\nuid: 2af8f\ntype: task\ntopic: orion_acceptance_criteria\nimportance: 0.5\nttl_days: 30\ntimestamp: 1778125799\n\ncontent:\nOrion海外支付网关 目前最缺的是一致的验收口径，需先补齐口径表。\n\n[Memory]\nuid: 9d780\ntype: task\ntopic: bluewhale_tracking\nimportance: 0.5\nttl_days: 30\ntimestamp: 1778125799\n\ncontent:\n蓝鲸报表 的埋点漏了一段，需前端补充从配置页返回列表页的路径。\n\n[Memory]\nuid: 96a92\ntype: constraint\ntopic: orion_review_guidelines\nimportance: 0.5\nttl_days: 30\ntimestamp: 1778125799\n\ncontent:\nOrion海外支付网关 复盘时需区分真实缺陷和沟通成本，不要所有问题都归到研发延期。\n\n[Memory]\nuid: 94528\ntype: task\ntopic: polaris_gray_data\nimportance: 0.5\nttl_days: 30\ntimestamp: 1778125799\n\ncontent:\nPolaris 今天灰度数据稳定，但门店经理希望有一个解释按钮，优先级高。\n\n[Memory]\nuid: 2911e\ntype: preference\ntopic: customer_certainty\nimportance: 0.5\nttl_days: 180\ntimestamp: 1778125799\n\ncontent:\n客户侧目前最关心确定性，需宁愿上线慢一点，也不要上线后反复改口。\n\n[Memory]\nuid: cdb20", "full_doc_id": "doc-0fb8a3ddfb18681afc85307d9feb82eb", "file_path": "unknown_source", "vector": ""}, {"__id__": "chunk-6d888e6f6da53714a027c3ccd581e8d6", "__created_at__": 1778125799, "content": "content:\nPolaris 今天灰度数据稳定，但门店经理希望有一个解释按钮，优先级高。\n\n[Memory]\nuid: 2911e\ntype: preference\ntopic: customer_certainty\nimportance: 0.5\nttl_days: 180\ntimestamp: 1778125799\n\ncontent:\n客户侧目前最关心确定性，需宁愿上线慢一点，也不要上线后反复改口。\n\n[Memory]\nuid: cdb20\ntype: fact\ntopic: weekly_schedule\nimportance: 0.5\nttl_days: 30\ntimestamp: 1778125799\n\ncontent:\n本周整体节奏：星桥CRM按计划灰度，Falcon继续策略回放，蓝鲸报表在修口径，Polaris保持12家门店灰度不扩面。\n\n[Memory]\nuid: bbaf0\ntype: task\ntopic: risk_matrix\nimportance: 0.5\nttl_days: 30\ntimestamp: 1778125799\n\ncontent:\n请生成一个项目风险矩阵，包含影响、概率、负责人和缓解措施。", "full_doc_id": "doc-0fb8a3ddfb18681afc85307d9feb82eb", "file_path": "unknown_source", "vector": ""}, {"__id__": "chunk-471eda83a8dd026c916aaaefd37273c7", "__created_at__": 1778125844, "content": "[Memory]\nuid: d37bc\ntype: task\ntopic: star_bridge_crm_tracking\nimportance: 0.5\nttl_days: 30\ntimestamp: 1778125844\n\ncontent:\n星桥CRM 的埋点漏了一段，尤其是从配置页返回列表页的路径，需要前端补一下。\n\n[Memory]\nuid: 6ec40\ntype: preference\ntopic: polaris_smart_scheduling_demo\nimportance: 0.5\nttl_days: 30\ntimestamp: 1778125844\n\ncontent:\nPolaris智能排班 的客户演示最好不要展示后台配置细节，直接走业务场景会更容易理解。\n\n[Memory]\nuid: 6bd39\ntype: task\ntopic: orion_overseas_payment_gateway_tracking\nimportance: 0.5\nttl_days: 30\ntimestamp: 1778125844\n\ncontent:\nOrion海外支付网关 的埋点漏了一段，尤其是从配置页返回列表页的路径，需要前端补一下。\n\n[Memory]\nuid: 5506a\ntype: task\ntopic: blue_whale_report_tracking\nimportance: 0.5\nttl_days: 30\ntimestamp: 1778125844\n\ncontent:\n蓝鲸报表 的埋点漏了一段，尤其是从配置页返回列表页的路径，需要前端补一下。\n\n[Memory]\nuid: 1a026\ntype: task\ntopic: falcon_risk_control_acceptance_criteria\nimportance: 0.5\nttl_days: 30\ntimestamp: 1778125844\n\ncontent:\nFalcon风控中台 目前最缺的是一致的验收口径，不是更多功能。请大家先把口径表补齐。\n\n[Memory]\nuid: 08ba6\ntype: fact\ntopic: polaris_audit_log\nimportance: 0.5\nttl_days: 30\ntimestamp: 1778125844\n\ncontent:\nPolaris 的审计日志字段已经入库，后面法务如果需要抽查，可以按门店、日期和规则版本过滤。\n\n[Memory]\nuid: f8e3d\ntype: goal\ntopic: polaris_review_metrics\nimportance: 0.5\nttl_days: 14\ntimestamp: 1778125844\n\ncontent:\nPolaris 两周后评审的核心指标为：人工覆盖率、员工连续晚班次数、班次缺口率和门店经理满意度。\n\n[Memory]\nuid: 0a9ad\ntype: fact\ntopic: meeting_minutes\nimportance: 0.5\nttl_days: 30\ntimestamp: 1778125844\n\ncontent:\n会议纪要包含：1. 背景：团队围绕当前项目的交付范围、依赖和风险进行了同步；2. 结论：优先保障核心链路可用，非关键功能进入后续迭代；3. 待办：产品补充验收口径，研发拆分接口清单，测试补充回归用例，运营准备灰度名单；4. 风险：数据口径、权限边界、第三方接口稳定性仍需持续跟踪。\n\n[Memory]\nuid: 1648c\ntype: fact\ntopic: root_cause_analysis\nimportance: 0.5\nttl_days: 30\ntimestamp: 1778125844\n\ncontent:\n上游数据延迟、规则阈值变更、缓存未刷新、灰度名单扩大、第三方接口抖动可能是导致问题的根因。建议按时间线复盘变更记录，拉取关键指标曲线，比较灰度组与对照组，并对异常请求做 trace 级别抽样。", "full_doc_id": "doc-471eda83a8dd026c916aaaefd37273c7", "file_path": "unknown_source", "vector": ""}, {"__id__": "chunk-ba4d29410abffdce79445e33a129bf72", "__created_at__": 1778125872, "content": "[Memory]\nuid: 0748d\ntype: task\ntopic: blue_whale_report_tracking\nimportance: 0.5\nttl_days: 30\ntimestamp: 1778125872\n\ncontent:\n蓝鲸报表的埋点需要前端补充，尤其是从配置页返回列表页的路径。\n\n[Memory]\nuid: efc18\ntype: task\ntopic: polaris_smart_scheduling_tracking\nimportance: 0.5\nttl_days: 30\ntimestamp: 1778125872\n\ncontent:\nPolaris智能排班的埋点需要前端补充，尤其是从配置页返回列表页的路径。\n\n[Memory]\nuid: 7f494\ntype: fact\ntopic: polaris_review_metrics\nimportance: 1.0\nttl_days: 14\ntimestamp: 1778125872\n\ncontent:\nPolaris两周后评审的核心指标为：人工覆盖率、员工连续晚班次数、班次缺口率和门店经理满意度。\n\n[Memory]\nuid: a8cf6\ntype: fact\ntopic: polaris_decision_update\nimportance: 1.0\nttl_days: 30\ntimestamp: 1778125872\n\ncontent:\nPolaris的决策变更已同步给管理层，后续不再引用旧的5月底全量计划。\n\n[Memory]\nuid: a310e\ntype: constraint\ntopic: xingqiao_crm_review_guideline\nimportance: 0.5\nttl_days: 3